// Decor prefab library (design: docs/DECOR.md). Loaded after 10-prefabs and before 30-rooms.
//
// Rules this file follows (docs/DECOR.md "Conventions"):
// - A prop's ROOT is the lowest part that touches its support, so `Rests` on an instance lands the whole prop on a surface.
//   Parts stacked on the root are children with `Rests`; everything else is a child with a Center relative to the root.
// - Parts that must change colour with a variant are small geometry prefabs (SeatBack, SofaArm, ...) so a variant only
//   restates `Albedo` on them. Neutral parts (plinths, cushions, handles, cords) are never recoloured.
// - Surfaces (tables, wall shelves, rugs) and floor props state their own Center.y in the prefab; an instance copies it.
//   Exporter spec S3 (docs/DECOR.md) would make floor props rest automatically.
// - The shader has one lamp (kind 9) and one accent (kind 3) per floor in the lighting tables: NO decor part is kind 9.
//   Kind 3 pieces (neon) all share their floor's colour. Lamp shades are bright warm albedo, not emitters (spec S2).

// ---- relation vocabulary (plain entities used as relation or target; ignored by today's exporter) ----------------
Hangs {}
Illuminates {}
Near {}
Pairs {}
Tint {}
BackWall {}
Interior {}
Upholstery {}
Paint {}

// ---- materials ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
prefab Fabric : Solid { Material: {0.95, 0} }
prefab Metal : Solid { Albedo: {0.16, 0.16, 0.17}
  Material: {0.3, 0.9} }
prefab Gloss : Solid { Material: {0.12, 0} }
prefab Shade : Solid { Albedo: {1.0, 0.8, 0.5}
  Material: {0.9, 0} }
prefab Ball : Leaf { Material: {0.4, 0} }
prefab Plank : Wood { Albedo: {0.32, 0.2, 0.1} }

// ---- neon: kind 3, glows with the floor's accent colour, LampColour is the HDR tube colour ---------------------
prefab Neon : Object { Kind: {3}
  (Illuminates, Interior) }
prefab NeonPink : Neon { LampColour: {6, 0.8, 3.2} }
prefab NeonCyan : Neon { LampColour: {0.6, 4.2, 6} }
prefab NeonLime : Neon { LampColour: {1.4, 6, 0.8} }
prefab NeonAmber : Neon { LampColour: {6, 2.2, 0.4} }

// A wall sign: dark board with tube bars (half thickness 0.011) 0.012 in front of it. Instances: Center {x, y, 0.011}.
